<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23">Hello Nasir,</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 0 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-left:3px solid #2E4A66;padding:0 0 0 16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Thank you for sharing the Claude chat conversation: <a href="https://claude.ai/share/ee4365be-afae-4e52-bac2-151b024d26c0" style="color:#2E4A66;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#AFC0D1;font-weight:500;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:normal">https://claude.ai/share/ee4365be-afae-4e52-bac2-151b024d26c0</a></p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Done: The chat helped me understand the missing key parts, along with the GHL connection to calendar protocols. I passed the chat and that context to Mr Abaiyaz, and it is now urgent tier priority.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Waiting: Back-to-back QA sessions run today, Tuesday, November 17 (PST). We are waiting on those results.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Next: Whether or not the functionality and tests pass, you will have a confirmed status update by Wednesday, November 18 (PST), based on today&#x27;s QA results.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">TLDR of the shared chat</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">The ask: a Claude system that tracks team tasks and follow-ups from G Suite email and sends reminders, so due dates are not missed.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">The design: emails labeled &quot;Action&quot; go into a Google Sheet. A scheduled Claude run each weekday morning flags overdue and due-soon tasks, checks threads for replies, and sends a digest.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Two conditions from the chat: Claude only drafts reminders (&quot;Never send email. Drafts only.&quot;), and each team member connects their own Gmail and Google Sheets in their own Claude account, with the Workspace admin allowing it.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">The flow, step by step</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Highlighted steps need a person. The other steps Claude does.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">1 · placeholder</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Claude</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
